      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-API-KEY",
        "description": "A **Company** API key, in the X-API-KEY header. Three key classes exist and do not interchange: a Service account key (API v4) and a Career key (Careers API) are both refused here with 401. Each of the four key permissions defaults to None, so a new key is refused with 403 until they are granted."
